'''October Gauntlet''' (10月強襲！, ''10 Gatsu Kyōshū！'', '''October Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during October and was added in the [[Version 10.9 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Autumn = Sports Day! (Monthly Event)|Autumn = Sports Day!]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
The October Gauntlet contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] stages, called '''Sports Day Lvs''' (運動会 Lvs.). After beating an Sports Day Lv, the player must wait for 30 minutes before they may enter the map again. Rewards for the first completion of an Sports Day Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Shard and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[October Gauntlet/Sports Day Lv.1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*October Gauntlet is unlocked after clearing [[Autumn = Sports Day! (Monthly Event)|Autumn = Sports Day!]].

